	(text "B. POWER  (nRF9161 PS 11.3.1 + nRF91 HDG Table 2 + nRF9161 DK FB3)\nVIN 3.0-5.5 V. VDD1=VDD2 same rail via low-DCR ferrites.\nDEC0=4.7uF (nRF91x1 family). VDD_GPIO 3.3 V LDO EN=ENABLE so GPIO rail falls when SiP is disabled.\nJP1 open = current measurement. Place C4/C8 closest to SiP pins."
